# component-architecture

The media card component system implements a two-tiered architecture for content display:

1. Base Media Card (`src/components/card-media.astro`)
- Core presentation component for standard media content
- Parent template defining common display patterns

2. YouTube Extension (`src/components/card-youtube.astro`)
- Specialized card implementation for YouTube content
- Inherits base media card structure
- Adds YouTube-specific embedding capabilities

The architecture follows a template inheritance pattern with specialized media type implementations extending from the base card component.

Business Importance Score: 45
- While providing content structure, the components primarily handle presentation without complex business rules
- Template inheritance pattern enables consistent media display across the CMS

